false}}, {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/comments/1756463848", "html_url": "https://github.com/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/2152#issuecomment-1756463848", "issue_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/2152", "id": 1756463848, "node_id": "IC_kwDOBabE0s5osYLo", "user": {"login": "OliverHeilmann", "id": 49697817, "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjQ5Njk3ODE3", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/49697817?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/OliverHeilmann", "html_url": "https://github.com/OliverHeilmann", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/OliverHeilmann/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/OliverHeilmann/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/OliverHeilmann/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/OliverHeilmann/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/OliverHeilmann/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/OliverHeilmann/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/OliverHeilmann/repos", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/OliverHeilmann/events{/privacy}", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/OliverHeilmann/received_events", "type": "User", "user_view_type": "public", "site_admin": false}, "created_at": "2023-10-10T23:33:16Z", "updated_at": "2023-10-10T23:33:16Z", "body": "I can see how my post was a little confusing, sorry!\r\n\r\nThe segfault arrises when using the mavsdk `takeoff` (blocking) command while connected to an ArduPlane. I have been testing using ArduPilot SITL. I am not 100% sure where exactly this error is coming from but it only happens when I use this `takeoff` command. \r\n\r\nMy code logic is the same/ similar to the mavsdk examples:\r\n- Push Mission Items (including setting takeoff altitude)\r\n- Upload Mission\r\n- Arm\r\n- Takeoff (I have tried takeoff after Start Mission as well)\r\n- Start Mission\r\n\r\nFor the ArduRover, I don't need the takeoff command so haven't had any issues. For the ArduCopter, I have posted in #2031 about my findings, but using the takeoff command also has some issues. \r\n\r\nFor ArduPlane, I am getting this segfault as well as an error in the mavsdk logs which reads  _\"Cannot translate flight mode to ArduPilot Plane mode\"_ (which is in the images I provided).", "author_association": "NONE", "pin": null, "reactions": {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/comments/1756463848/reactions", "total_count": 0, "+1": 0, "-1": 0, "laugh": 0, "hooray": 0, "confused": 0, "heart": 0, "rocket": 0, "eyes": 0}, "performed_via_github_app": null, "minimized": null, "event": "commented", "actor": {"login": "OliverHeilmann", "id": 49697817, "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjQ5Njk3ODE3", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/49697817?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/OliverHeilmann", "html_url": "https://github.com/OliverHeilmann", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/OliverHeilmann/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/OliverHeilmann/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/OliverHeilmann/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/OliverHeilmann/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/OliverHeilmann/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/OliverHeilmann/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/OliverHeilmann/repos", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/OliverHeilmann/events{/privacy}", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/OliverHeilmann/received_events", "type": "User", "user_view_type": "public", "site_admin": false}}, {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/comments/1757232155", "html_url": "https://github.com/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/2152#issuecomment-1757232155", "issue_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/2152", "id": 1757232155, "node_id": "IC_kwDOBabE0s5ovTwb", "user": {"login": "JonasVautherin", "id": 2606672, "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjI2MDY2NzI=", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2606672?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/JonasVautherin", "html_url": "https://github.com/JonasVautherin", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/JonasVautherin/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/JonasVautherin/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/JonasVautherin/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/JonasVautherin/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/JonasVautherin/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/JonasVautherin/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/JonasVautherin/repos", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/JonasVautherin/events{/privacy}", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/JonasVautherin/received_events", "type": "User", "user_view_type": "public", "site_admin": false}, "created_at": "2023-10-11T09:16:26Z", "updated_at": "2023-10-11T09:16:26Z", "body": "The error message comes from [here](https://github.com/mavlink/MAVSDK/blob/main/src/mavsdk/core/system_impl.cpp#L872), I assume that it gets a `MAV_TYPE::MAV_TYPE_FIXED_WING`. And apparently [`flight_mode_to_ardupilot_plane_mode`](https://github.com/mavlink/MAVSDK/blob/main/src/mavsdk/core/system_impl.cpp#L972) returned `PlaneMode::Unknown`.\r\n\r\nIt would be nice to check what `FlightMode` is passed there that returns `Unknown`. Still it should not segfault, but this is already an issue IMO.", "author_association": "COLLABORATOR", "pin": null, "reactions": {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/comments/1757232155/reactions", "total_count": 0, "+1": 0, "-1": 0, "laugh": 0, "hooray": 0, "confused": 0, "heart": 0, "rocket": 0, "eyes": 0}, "performed_via_g